#. i18n: ectx: property (whatsThis), widget (QCheckBox, useAntialiasing)
#: src/part/dialog.ui:291
msgid ""
"Anti-aliasing the filemap makes it clearer and prettier, unfortunately it "
"also makes rendering very slow."
